# Staged models/datasets/tiles/index/provenance are gigabytes, machine-
# specific, and already gitignored - bind-mounted at run time instead of
# baked into the image (see Dockerfile's top comment and docker-compose.yml).
# The Dockerfile recreates the empty directory skeleton itself at build time.
